re, and 41% reach +6 by move 24.","Watch your rook: it is behind 19% of your lost leads, 1.2\u00d7 the usual rate, most often the king's rook (58%), landing on e1, d1, b7.","Aim at their knight: it is behind 24% of their lost leads, 1.3\u00d7 the usual rate, most often the queen's knight (60%). The reply wins it outright 13% of the time. Take it with a bishop.","Material changes hands for you on d8 and f7: build pressure there.","They win material on e4 and e5: keep those squares defended.","Look for the rook / bishop fork: it appears 2.5\u00d7 as often as usual in this opening."],"similar":[],"family":"Caro-Kann Defense"}